  "body": "Set in a peaceful and family-friendly part of Orewa, this brand-new residence offers more than just modern comfort. Thoughtfully designed with four bedrooms, three bathrooms, and two living areas, the home provides exceptional flexibility for growing families, extended family living, guests, or those seeking additional space for work and relaxation. Set on an approximately 324sqm section with around 162sqm of floor area (including the porch), the home combines generous accommodation with an easy-care lifestyle. A 10-Year Master Build Guarantee adds valuable peace of mind, while the home's versatile layout offers plenty of potential for the way your family may evolve over time.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n-The kitchen, dining, and main living areas are thoughtfully connected, creating a bright and welcoming hub for family life, entertaining, and relaxing together.\r\n-The kitchen features a large island, quality appliances, and generous storage, combining modern design with everyday functionality.\r\n-Large sliding doors open onto a sunny deck and landscaped garden, extending the living space outdoors and creating an ideal setting for alfresco dining, entertaining, or unwinding in the sunshine.\r\n-Granny Potential - A dedicated one-bedroom, one-living-area, one-bathroom zone offers excellent flexibility for extended family, elderly, guests, or independent living, while providing valuable privacy and separation from the main home.\r\n-The master bedroom offers a peaceful space to unwind, complete with a generous walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\n-Two further well-proportioned bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation for children, guests, or a home office, supported by a modern family bathroom with a bathtub.\r\n-A single internal-access garage completes the practical layout, offering secure parking, convenient access, and useful additional storage for everyday essentials.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home, the location makes everyday living wonderfully easy. Local schools, parks, shops, cafés, supermarkets, public transport, and scenic walking tracks are all within easy reach. The Northern Motorway provides convenient connections to Auckland City and the North Shore, while Orewa Beach is just minutes away for swimming, walking, and enjoying the relaxed coastal atmosphere.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a spacious family home, planning for multi-generational living, or simply want the flexibility that granny potential can provide, this brand-new Orewa residence offers an opportunity to enjoy modern living with room to adapt.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your viewing and discover the flexibility this home has to offer.",
